  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The book(from a project called:notes&amp;lists) has the title :Liste: elf Zen Sätze. (list: eleven Zen sentences) The 11 Sentences are written with typewriter, collected from my notebooks.I am more a follower of the Chinese CHAN,than of Japanese Zen. Red Pine(=Bill Porter) has translated them into English. The double page in the middle of the book is a poem by myself, composed out of the sentences and my own words." From Artist's Correspondence, edited by M. Murphy 6-20-2011.</subfield>
